            0.111
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it Out"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.122,
            0.67,
            0.193
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Using the token interpretation, find the values of: (a)\t 3 × (– 2) (b)\t (– 5) × (– 2) (c)\t (– 4) × (– 1) (d)\t (– 7) × 3"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.201,
            0.753,
            0.272
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2.\tIf 123 × 456 = 56088, without calculating, find the value of: (a)\t (– 123) × 456 (b)\t (– 123) × (– 456) (c)\t (123) × (– 456)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.282,
            0.688,
            0.304
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Try to frame a simple rule to multiply two integers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.817,
            0.263,
            0.904,
            0.314
          ],
          "content": [
